  "text": "OT: I'm not clear on whether or not Sweep is fully open source - I mean, can you run it fully self-hosted (apart from the GPT4 engine obv), or is the repo essentially a client to a Sweep API/binary?Cool project btw!\n\nThanks! The repo is just the backend that runs the GitHub webhooks. We used to have a \"chat with your code\" client but stopped supporting it. Now it's only the GitHub interface with creating tickets and comments.\n\nThanks for the clarification.",
